check {
    `reqlan check` should run perform the following checks:
    - ensure all rq [reference] point to real nodes, unless rq ignored with [comment_reference_ignore].
    - this tests rqcomments point to real parts of the namespace, that code references exist, and that rq references exists.
    - report unresolved imports: [check_unresolved_imports].
    - report unused imports: [check_unused_imports].
    - report a comment reference with invalid syntax: [code_comment_syntax_errors].
    - report an `.rq` parse failure: [check_rq_syntax].
    - report a qualified reference whose file is not on disk: [check_qualified_missing_file].
    - report a qualified reference whose `.rq` file does not declare the idea: [check_qualified_missing_idea].
    - it should really just be a wrapper of the [index] and return the issues (as a pipe, terminal output, or json).
    Issue order: [check_order_by_target]. Sparse wildcards: [check_wildcard_sparse] via flags [check_wildcard_zero] and [check_wildcard_one]. Path globs: [check_glob_patterns]. Skip missing targets: [check_skip_targets] [check_skip_gitignored_targets]. Bypass ideas-index SQLite: [check_no_cache]. Sync diagnostics on stderr: [check_verbose]. CLI: ["../cli/cli_package.rq".commands]. MCP: ["../extension/agent/skills-and-mcp.rq".mcp_check]. CI: [check_meta_implementation]. Site demo: ["../site/site.rq".broken_links_showcase].
    @status done
    @implementation (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/src/check/mod.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/src/path_resolve.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/src/rq_ignore.rs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-analytical/src/api.rs"]
        ["../../packages/cli/src/commands/check.ts"]
        ["../../packages/cli/src/format-broken-refs.ts"]
        ["../../packages/mcp/src/server.ts"]
    )
    @tests (
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:skips_idea_and_comment_refs_on_rq_ignore_error_lines"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_missing_file_refs_and_skips_existing"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_qualified_reference_to_a_missing_file"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_accepts_qualified_reference_when_the_file_exists"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_qualified_reference_to_a_missing_idea"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_namespace_qualified_reference_to_a_missing_idea"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_skips_qualified_missing_idea_on_rq_ignore_error"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_strips_test_name_and_line_suffix_before_file_exists"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_accepts_test_names_that_contain_colons_from_nested_rq"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_skips_same_file_idea_refs_and_reports_true_missing"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_accepts_import_root_alias_file_refs"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-analytical/tests/broken_references.rs:analysis_api_lists_broken_refs_with_glob_and_comments"]
        ["../../packages/cli/test/check.test.ts:checks files from two globs and one file outside them"]
        ["../../packages/cli/test/check.test.ts:reports unresolved idea, comment, and file refs and exits 1"]
        ["../../packages/cli/test/check.test.ts:reports unresolved imports and exits 1"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_a_malformed_comment_reference"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_missing_import_path"]
        ["../../crates/reqlan-index/tests/broken_references.rs:check_reports_missing_imported_idea"]
        ["../../packages/cli/test/check.test.ts:exits 0 when there are no issues"]
        ["../../packages/cli/test/check.test.ts:quotes source paths that contain spaces"]
